# Future Workflow Extensibility

The current one-step workflow must not be hardcoded so tightly that future multi-stage approval requires rewriting the billing engine.

Future possibility:

Draft
↓
Manager
↓
Finance
↓
CFO
↓
Approved

Possible future rules:

- amount-based approvals
- company-based approvals
- document-type-based approvals
- role-based approvals
- multi-stage approval
- conditional transitions

Do not implement a generic workflow builder for MVP.

Architecture should simply remain capable of future extension.

